# Repository branch policy

This repo (`brunabaudel/ebb`) is the **dedicated Ebb iOS app repository**.

## `main` — Ebb iOS app

- Contains the full app: `Ebb/`, `docs/`, `.github/workflows/`, CI, and Cursor skills.
- Codemagic unit tests run on pushes and PRs to `main` (when `Ebb/**` changes).

## Feature branches

- Branch feature work from `main` (e.g. `cursor/my-feature-2c92`).
- Open PRs **into `main`**.

## Agent checklist

1. Confirm which branch you are on before editing.
2. App changes → branch off `main`, PR base = `main`.
3. Preserve app identity (bundle ID, entitlements, assets) unless explicitly asked to change them.
